#. module: integration
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/integration/models/integration_sale_order_factory.py:0
msgid ""
"The total amount in the sales order from \"%s\" differs from the calculated "
"amount in Odoo, usually due to rounding issues or tax discrepancies.\n"
"Order amounts: %f (Odoo) vs %f (%s)\n"
"\n"
"Odoo and \"%s\" calculate taxes differently, which can lead to this issue. "
"To resolve it, you can either:\n"
"1. Go to \"E-Commerce Integrations → Stores → %s\".\n"
"Navigate to the \"Sales Orders\" tab, and in the \"Order Extras Management\" "
"section, configure the products to be used for compensating price "
"differences.\n"
"2. Alternatively, you can disable the \"Order Total Difference Correction\" "
"checkbox on the same tab if you do not want Odoo to handle price "
"discrepancies.\n"
"\n"
"Once the issue is resolved, requeue the job, and the sales order will be "
"created in Odoo with the correct total."
msgstr ""
"El importe total en la orden de venta de \"%s\" difiere del importe "
"calculado en Odoo, normalmente por problemas de redondeo o discrepancias de "
"impuestos.\n"
"Importes del pedido: %f (Odoo) vs %f (%s)\n"
"\n"
"Odoo y \"%s\" calculan los impuestos de forma diferente, lo que puede "
"provocar este problema. Para resolverlo, podés:\n"
"1. Ir a \"Integraciones de E-Commerce → Tiendas → %s\".\n"
"   Entrá en la pestaña \"Órdenes de venta\" y, en la sección \"Gestión de "
"extras del pedido\", configurá los productos que se usarán para compensar "
"diferencias de precio.\n"
"2. Alternativamente, podés desactivar la casilla \"Corrección de diferencia "
"del total del pedido\" en esa misma pestaña si no querés que Odoo gestione "
"las discrepancias de precio.\n"
"\n"
"Una vez resuelto, reencolá el job y la orden de venta se creará en Odoo con "
"el total correcto."

#. module: integration
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/integration/models/mixins/integration_external_mixin.py:0
