"for the relevant connector, as outlined in the corresponding connector's "
"documentation.\n"
"Once the product is properly mapped, you will be able to refresh product "
"information from the external system."
msgstr ""
"Este producto no está conectado a ninguna tienda de e-commerce (por ejemplo, "
"Shopify, Prestashop, Magento 2, WooCommerce).\n"
"\n"
"Para resolverlo, realizá la importación inicial de productos y el mapeo para "
