"<code>res.partner</code>) usará el conector para identificar clientes "
"existentes al importar pedidos."

#. module: integration
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:integration.view_integration_import_wizard_form
msgid ""
"This step <strong>does not create</strong> any Odoo products.\n"
"                                It only builds or updates mappings between "
"external and Odoo records.\n"
"                                You can manually review and create missing "
"products later via the Mappings menu."
msgstr ""
"Este paso <strong>no crea</strong> ningún producto en Odoo.\n"
"                                Solo construye o actualiza los mapeos entre "
"registros externos y registros de Odoo.\n"
"                                Podés revisar y crear manualmente los "
"productos faltantes más adelante desde el menú \"Mapeos\"."

#. module: integration
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:integration.view_sale_integration_form
msgid ""
"This step initiates stock level synchronization between your e-commerce "
"platform and Odoo.\n"
"                                                By clicking on \"Import "
"Stock Levels,\" you will access a wizard that helps you map external\n"
"                                                warehouse locations to their "
"corresponding locations in Odoo. Once set up, the system\n"
"                                                will align stock quantities "
"to reflect your current inventory."
msgstr ""
"Este paso inicia la sincronización de niveles de stock entre tu plataforma "
"de e-commerce y Odoo.\n"
"                                                Al hacer clic en \"Importar "
"niveles de stock\", vas a acceder a un asistente que te ayuda a mapear "
"ubicaciones de depósito externas con sus ubicaciones correspondientes en "
"Odoo. Una vez configurado, el sistema alineará las cantidades de stock para "
"reflejar tu inventario actual."

#. module: integration
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:integration.view_integration_import_wizard_form
msgid ""
"This step will prepare your external product catalog and try to match it "
"with existing Odoo products.\n"
"                                It does <strong>not</strong> create any new "
"products in Odoo - only mappings will be created or updated where matches "
"are found."
msgstr ""
